  "description": [
    "A \u03b3-amino acid that is \u03b3-aminobutyric acid (GABA) carrying an isobutyl substitutent at the \u03b2-position (the <i>S</i>-enantiomer). Binds with high affinity to the \u03b1<small><sub>2</sub></small>-\u03b4 site (an auxiliary subunit of voltage-gated calcium channels) in central nervous system tissues."
